(3034498, 425881, 5112, '<td valign="top">OK, I doublechecked, both your portfolio (self-portrait) and melethia''s photo of you, and you''re right.  The most obvious is the different glasses.  Sorry about confusing you with this guy.  I still think it''s a neat idea :)  And at least to the casual viewer you two look a bit alike.<br/> <br/>Sorry also about all the bad vibes with HDR.  The whole thing really got on my nerves, something fierce.</td>', 'OK, I doublechecked, both your portfolio (self-portrait) and melethia''s photo of you, and you''re right.  The most obvious is the different glasses.  Sorry about confusing you with this guy.  I still think it''s a neat idea :)  And at least to the casual viewer you two look a bit alike. Sorry also about all the bad vibes with HDR.  The whole thing really got on my nerves, something fierce.', '2006-11-15 13:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3034519, 425961, 60223, '<td valign="top">You''ve really done a disservice to the subject with this photo.  Subject needs to be sharper and perhaps a little brighter.  You also have trees growing out of the womans head so a better framing before snapping the picture would have helped as well.  I think putting the trees/sky completely in the background and then using fill flash would have moved this photo up a few notches.</td>', 'You''ve really done a disservice to the subject with this photo.  Subject needs to be sharper and perhaps a little brighter.  You also have trees growing out of the womans head so a better framing before snapping the picture would have helped as well.  I think putting the trees/sky completely in the background and then using fill flash would have moved this photo up a few notches.', '2006-11-15 13:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
