(3035334, 427556, 327, '<td valign="top">Love this with her eyes..great blue going on. She''s so sweet looking. I thing a tighter crop would of made this pop a bit more. More impact. All the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Love this with her eyes..great blue going on. She''s so sweet looking. I thing a tighter crop would of made this pop a bit more. More impact. All the best in the challenge.', '2006-11-15 17:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3035343, 427592, 327, '<td valign="top">Hum. I love your set up-focus and the over all style-spot on for the challenge. The weakness is the lighting. To bright and it makes everything look washed out and a bit on the flat side. The vest is fried in the light. Maybe a diffuser on your flash or your lights? Also you could bump up the saturation a little to help this pop.</td>', 'Hum. I love your set up-focus and the over all style-spot on for the challenge. The weakness is the lighting. To bright and it makes everything look washed out and a bit on the flat side. The vest is fried in the light. Maybe a diffuser on your flash or your lights? Also you could bump up the saturation a little to help this pop.', '2006-11-15 17:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3035346, 427602, 56756, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely beautiful.  I love this picture.  Great job!</td>', 'This is absolutely beautiful.  I love this picture.  Great job!', '2006-11-15 17:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3035353, 427585, 327, '<td valign="top">Okay. I like your idea, style, and the feel/mood is good with this hat and cigar. The weakness is the lighting and the wrinkled backdrop. Too bright and it''s washing out the wood grain and frying the yellow cigar box. You did a great job setting this up, but the mood should be a bit darker..you know sexy or mysterious. Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Okay. I like your idea, style, and the feel/mood is good with this hat and cigar. The weakness is the lighting and the wrinkled backdrop. Too bright and it''s washing out the wood grain and frying the yellow cigar box. You did a great job setting this up, but the mood should be a bit darker..you know sexy or mysterious. Best of luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-15 18:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3035357, 426160, 327, '<td valign="top">Just don''t feel the connection here with this man and the hats he''s selling. Maybe we don''t see enough of the scene.</td>', 'Just don''t feel the connection here with this man and the hats he''s selling. Maybe we don''t see enough of the scene.', '2006-11-15 18:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3035358, 426354, 56756, '<td valign="top">As I am not a professional-this is my opinion.  I think the picture is a little grainy-i dont know if that is post processing or just the camera settings.  I think the picture would have turned out even better if it was very clear and solid becuase of the solid color behind her.<br/> <br/>Other than that the pic is very nice.</td>', 'As I am not a professional-this is my opinion.  I think the picture is a little grainy-i dont know if that is post processing or just the camera settings.  I think the picture would have turned out even better if it was very clear and solid becuase of the solid color behind her. Other than that the pic is very nice.', '2006-11-15 18:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3035361, 427568, 56756, '<td valign="top">My favorite color!!</td>', 'My favorite color!!', '2006-11-15 18:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3035362, 427391, 18073, '<td valign="top">I know what you were trying to achieve here but I don''t think it quite worked.  For one the shape of the hat is not that well defined merging into botyh the sky and rock.  Also there is a real lack of detail in the scene with the foreground a little out of focus and over exposed.<br/> <br/>It was a good idea, and the landscape is very nice, perhaps had you used a tripod and not used flash the image might have been a little more successful.</td>', 'I know what you were trying to achieve here but I don''t think it quite worked.  For one the shape of the hat is not that well defined merging into botyh the sky and rock.  Also there is a real lack of detail in the scene with the foreground a little out of focus and over exposed. It was a good idea, and the landscape is very nice, perhaps had you used a tripod and not used flash the image might have been a little more successful.', '2006-11-15 18:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3035364, 426967, 327, '<td valign="top">Alright- this just seems awkward, she''s on the chair, half on it anyway and the chair pattern is busy. That along with the half head tilted looks a bit off to me. I think she darling with fantastic eyes! <b>Wow</b> She needs good light, and nothing to distract from HER. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Alright- this just seems awkward, she''s on the chair, half on it anyway and the chair pattern is busy. That along with the half head tilted looks a bit off to me. I think she darling with fantastic eyes! Wow She needs good light, and nothing to distract from HER. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-15 18:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3035366, 427534, 327, '<td valign="top">Humm, I like this. The light (high Key) is very attractive. She could loose that shirt. Her skin looks so great.</td>', 'Humm, I like this. The light (high Key) is very attractive. She could loose that shirt. Her skin looks so great.', '2006-11-15 18:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
