(3036389, 427611, 64446, '<td valign="top">Very creative composition, with the cat is on the right position and her great suprising expression.... You could have pushed on saturation and contrast, as the colors and contrast are somewhat flat, with too blown on the left.</td>', 'Very creative composition, with the cat is on the right position and her great suprising expression.... You could have pushed on saturation and contrast, as the colors and contrast are somewhat flat, with too blown on the left.', '2006-11-16 00:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
