(3036637, 427408, 56400, '<td valign="top">I can''t help but laugh at this one, the expression is priceless. It could use just a little more saturation, but it''s a great shot.</td>', 'I can''t help but laugh at this one, the expression is priceless. It could use just a little more saturation, but it''s a great shot.', '2006-11-16 02:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3036656, 425924, 56400, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of my ex-wife in one of her moods.<br/>Seriously though, oh wait, I was serious. Uh...<br/>Photographically though, needs a little more light into the left side wing, it''s a little too dark.</td>', 'Reminds me of my ex-wife in one of her moods.Seriously though, oh wait, I was serious. Uh...Photographically though, needs a little more light into the left side wing, it''s a little too dark.', '2006-11-16 03:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3036701, 427578, 66201, '<td valign="top">There is another pic similar in content in this challenge, but I prefer this one: the composition is lovely and the focus in this is more "head wear" than hockey player. 8.</td>', 'There is another pic similar in content in this challenge, but I prefer this one: the composition is lovely and the focus in this is more "head wear" than hockey player. 8.', '2006-11-16 03:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3036702, 425693, 66201, '<td valign="top">Intriguing picture. Would work really well for the next challenege... I was born in the 60''s :). I like the b+w option and it keeps the viewer interested. 8.</td>', 'Intriguing picture. Would work really well for the next challenege... I was born in the 60''s :). I like the b+w option and it keeps the viewer interested. 8.', '2006-11-16 03:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3036706, 425702, 66201, '<td valign="top">While this is leaning towards being a really nice candid,I like the story/action in this: it''s not just a picture of a person in a hat. the person is actually doing something: there is story and movement in this. 8.</td>', 'While this is leaning towards being a really nice candid,I like the story/action in this: it''s not just a picture of a person in a hat. the person is actually doing something: there is story and movement in this. 8.', '2006-11-16 03:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3036707, 427173, 66201, '<td valign="top">Really well crafted: this captures the era so well. I like the shadow effect across the face. Well done. 8.</td>', 'Really well crafted: this captures the era so well. I like the shadow effect across the face. Well done. 8.', '2006-11-16 03:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3036712, 427237, 66201, '<td valign="top">A really well-composed shot. I like the squared-off format with subject balanced in the middle. I also like her downward focus..at first I wondered if it would have been more effective having her look at the camera, but then I decided that the picture speaks more with her looking down...kind of being led to wonder what she''s thinking...if that makes sense. The beads on the hat are a bit over-exposed and have lost some definition. 8.</td>', 'A really well-composed shot. I like the squared-off format with subject balanced in the middle. I also like her downward focus..at first I wondered if it would have been more effective having her look at the camera, but then I decided that the picture speaks more with her looking down...kind of being led to wonder what she''s thinking...if that makes sense. The beads on the hat are a bit over-exposed and have lost some definition. 8.', '2006-11-16 03:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3036713, 427426, 66201, '<td valign="top">Silly, fun, well composed, nice set up and ultimately meets the challenge spot on. 7.</td>', 'Silly, fun, well composed, nice set up and ultimately meets the challenge spot on. 7.', '2006-11-16 04:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3036714, 426515, 66201, '<td valign="top">I like the grain in this and the grey hue... I think compared to the other ice hockey picture in this challenge, this one tends to be more about the outfit, while the other is definitely more "head wear". 7.</td>', 'I like the grain in this and the grey hue... I think compared to the other ice hockey picture in this challenge, this one tends to be more about the outfit, while the other is definitely more "head wear". 7.', '2006-11-16 04:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3036715, 427366, 66201, '<td valign="top">Pretty, nice composition,meets the challenge, well-balanced light that creates a warm glow (too many others go for this shot and end up with complete blackness on one side of the face...half humans). 7.</td>', 'Pretty, nice composition,meets the challenge, well-balanced light that creates a warm glow (too many others go for this shot and end up with complete blackness on one side of the face...half humans). 7.', '2006-11-16 04:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3036716, 426453, 66201, '<td valign="top">I like this take on the theme. Also lovely colour craft: blues in denim and eyes, with the brown and sepia.</td>', 'I like this take on the theme. Also lovely colour craft: blues in denim and eyes, with the brown and sepia.', '2006-11-16 04:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3036717, 426412, 31443, '<td valign="top">Never was too keen on high contrast but getting used to it slowly, what I like mostly about this shot is the unpretentious color of the hat and clothing which make such great contrast with the eyes and attitude of model..</td>', 'Never was too keen on high contrast but getting used to it slowly, what I like mostly about this shot is the unpretentious color of the hat and clothing which make such great contrast with the eyes and attitude of model..', '2006-11-16 04:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3036719, 425997, 66201, '<td valign="top">This is such a sweet photo: it''s warm and well set up with lovely colour tones. I like it a lot, and I hope others think the same.</td>', 'This is such a sweet photo: it''s warm and well set up with lovely colour tones. I like it a lot, and I hope others think the same.', '2006-11-16 04:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3036720, 425247, 66201, '<td valign="top">I like the effect of the netting in background and foreground: this is a picture about head wear, without it being obviously a HAT. I also like that something is happening in this picture..it tells a story and is real...not a photo of a piece of head gear.</td>', 'I like the effect of the netting in background and foreground: this is a picture about head wear, without it being obviously a HAT. I also like that something is happening in this picture..it tells a story and is real...not a photo of a piece of head gear.', '2006-11-16 04:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3036722, 426180, 66201, '<td valign="top">Very cute, well crafted, great sharpness and interesting angle.</td>', 'Very cute, well crafted, great sharpness and interesting angle.', '2006-11-16 04:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3036724, 427319, 66201, '<td valign="top">Creative take on the challenge...well done: at last something DIFFERENT. Lovely composition and I like the look over the shoulder.</td>', 'Creative take on the challenge...well done: at last something DIFFERENT. Lovely composition and I like the look over the shoulder.', '2006-11-16 04:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3036725, 426377, 66201, '<td valign="top">While not obviously a picture of a HAT (which is what draws me to this picture), this meets the challenge and tells a bit of a story..something is happening in this picture and it''s real as opposed to being a still life.</td>', 'While not obviously a picture of a HAT (which is what draws me to this picture), this meets the challenge and tells a bit of a story..something is happening in this picture and it''s real as opposed to being a still life.', '2006-11-16 04:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3036726, 426196, 66201, '<td valign="top">Best of the Furry Hat Framing Face pictures in this challenge.</td>', 'Best of the Furry Hat Framing Face pictures in this challenge.', '2006-11-16 04:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
