(3037117, 426245, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this would have great impact if done in black and white. Then you could concentrate on the shadow/highlights of it. As it is, the composition is good, but it''s rather flat, as all of the colors kind of meld together.</td>', 'I think this would have great impact if done in black and white. Then you could concentrate on the shadow/highlights of it. As it is, the composition is good, but it''s rather flat, as all of the colors kind of meld together.', '2006-11-16 09:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037120, 427156, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOL.  I like the lighting.  I think if it were mine, I''d crop out a large majority of the left even if it meant losing part of the brim on the left side.</td>', 'LOL.  I like the lighting.  I think if it were mine, I''d crop out a large majority of the left even if it meant losing part of the brim on the left side.', '2006-11-16 09:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037126, 427343, 15711, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Artfully done but I sense a tad bit of flatness in the lighting/color. I wish his body and the background were a smidge more intense, OR it were black and white. Then you could really have some POP with the highlight of the hat. I like the diatonal line of it.</td>', 'Interesting.  Artfully done but I sense a tad bit of flatness in the lighting/color. I wish his body and the background were a smidge more intense, OR it were black and white. Then you could really have some POP with the highlight of the hat. I like the diatonal line of it.', '2006-11-16 09:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037141, 425877, 15711, '<td valign="top">Sweet face. Nice focus but the pink blanket really distracts. It gives it more of a snapshot sense. I''d love to see her in a setting with a solid black background and nothing on but that cute knitted cap. She''s a doll face~</td>', 'Sweet face. Nice focus but the pink blanket really distracts. It gives it more of a snapshot sense. I''d love to see her in a setting with a solid black background and nothing on but that cute knitted cap. She''s a doll face~', '2006-11-16 09:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037149, 427009, 15711, '<td valign="top">There''s my Charlie Chaplain guy from the wind challenge! Love the black and white. This has an old fashioned sense. Her shoes are killer. Great contrast and composition. One of the few interesting shots of the challenge! If I were to critique anything, I''d say that the truck/car in the background is a bit distracting, but it''s rather hard to ask your neighbors to remove their vehicles for a photo shoot. LOL</td>', 'There''s my Charlie Chaplain guy from the wind challenge! Love the black and white. This has an old fashioned sense. Her shoes are killer. Great contrast and composition. One of the few interesting shots of the challenge! If I were to critique anything, I''d say that the truck/car in the background is a bit distracting, but it''s rather hard to ask your neighbors to remove their vehicles for a photo shoot. LOL', '2006-11-16 09:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037152, 427366, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The lighting is good.  I think I''d have her remove the rings and not have the bra strap in the shot, so it''s just her, her skin and the hat. You could even crop it just above the strap. It would make for a differently shaped image, but I like shots that are rather square. Beautiful eyes. 7</td>', 'Nice idea. The lighting is good.  I think I''d have her remove the rings and not have the bra strap in the shot, so it''s just her, her skin and the hat. You could even crop it just above the strap. It would make for a differently shaped image, but I like shots that are rather square. Beautiful eyes. 7', '2006-11-16 09:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037155, 427408, 15711, '<td valign="top">OMG - Linda is that one of yours?  Adorable. One of the better shots.  This is funny and well executed. Love the striped sweater/hood. Great DOF. The focus on those eyes is great. Good one!! 8</td>', 'OMG - Linda is that one of yours?  Adorable. One of the better shots.  This is funny and well executed. Love the striped sweater/hood. Great DOF. The focus on those eyes is great. Good one!! 8', '2006-11-16 09:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037156, 426515, 18868, '<td valign="top">So crisp!  I love that you can see the texture of the shirt.</td>', 'So crisp!  I love that you can see the texture of the shirt.', '2006-11-16 09:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037158, 426589, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this but it''s lacking in artfulness. I''d like to have it in black and white and not have the crop so tight.  Either make it tighter, excluding part of the covering (it would still work) OR, have more negative space around him and not have him so centered. The focus is good. The detail of his face is interesting.</td>', 'I like the idea of this but it''s lacking in artfulness. I''d like to have it in black and white and not have the crop so tight.  Either make it tighter, excluding part of the covering (it would still work) OR, have more negative space around him and not have him so centered. The focus is good. The detail of his face is interesting.', '2006-11-16 09:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037159, 427496, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting.  If there were a person under that hat instead of a tablecloth, it would just be so much more interesting.</td>', 'Love the lighting.  If there were a person under that hat instead of a tablecloth, it would just be so much more interesting.', '2006-11-16 09:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037161, 427343, 18868, '<td valign="top">I don''t expect that the DPC voting will treat this kindly, but it''s one of my favorites from this challenge.   You''ll probably get lots of negative comments on the wide border, but I think it really makes it work well.  The lighting is very subtle, very beautiful.</td>', 'I don''t expect that the DPC voting will treat this kindly, but it''s one of my favorites from this challenge.   You''ll probably get lots of negative comments on the wide border, but I think it really makes it work well.  The lighting is very subtle, very beautiful.', '2006-11-16 09:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037162, 427079, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL Interesting take on the challenge.  His head is covered, but I''m wondering how it will be received. Funny shot. Would make a cute fall greeting card.</td>', 'ROFL Interesting take on the challenge.  His head is covered, but I''m wondering how it will be received. Funny shot. Would make a cute fall greeting card.', '2006-11-16 09:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037163, 427426, 15711, '<td valign="top">ROFL.  FUNNY.  Something about the colors in the background. I wonder if you could have done a legal saturation of only the orange in basic. Or maybe have the whoe shot in BW. Hmmmm - not sure.</td>', 'ROFL.  FUNNY.  Something about the colors in the background. I wonder if you could have done a legal saturation of only the orange in basic. Or maybe have the whoe shot in BW. Hmmmm - not sure.', '2006-11-16 09:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037164, 427300, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very 60''s (except for the earrings). I like her quirky expression. I even like the blown out light on her arm. 7</td>', 'Very 60''s (except for the earrings). I like her quirky expression. I even like the blown out light on her arm. 7', '2006-11-16 09:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037165, 427389, 18868, '<td valign="top">I like how the hat, while a very large part of the frame, doesn''t dominate it, instead it frames the face.</td>', 'I like how the hat, while a very large part of the frame, doesn''t dominate it, instead it frames the face.', '2006-11-16 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037169, 427459, 15711, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition. If this weren''t in the head covering challenge, I might think that was a life preserver.  The fluttering of the wings is beautiful. Quite artful.</td>', 'Lovely composition. If this weren''t in the head covering challenge, I might think that was a life preserver.  The fluttering of the wings is beautiful. Quite artful.', '2006-11-16 09:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037173, 427560, 15711, '<td valign="top">Funny idea, but the purple border really kills it for me. I think I''d rather see it in black and white with intense contrast. I like the diagonal line of the brim and the use of negative space. It could work as a high key shot, since the lighting on the upper part is already blown out.</td>', 'Funny idea, but the purple border really kills it for me. I think I''d rather see it in black and white with intense contrast. I like the diagonal line of the brim and the use of negative space. It could work as a high key shot, since the lighting on the upper part is already blown out.', '2006-11-16 09:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037174, 427360, 18868, '<td valign="top">I would normally say this was oversharpened and too contrasty -- BUT, in this case, it really makes the "wetness" very prominent, and I like it.  Proves that there are no hard-and-fast rules about processing...</td>', 'I would normally say this was oversharpened and too contrasty -- BUT, in this case, it really makes the "wetness" very prominent, and I like it.  Proves that there are no hard-and-fast rules about processing...', '2006-11-16 09:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
