(3037178, 427371, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  The hint of grain works. The vertical lines of the blinds add interest and texture. 7</td>', 'I like this one.  The hint of grain works. The vertical lines of the blinds add interest and texture. 7', '2006-11-16 09:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
