(3037189, 427356, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful idea. I would scoot her away from the textured wall, intensify the lighting, as the existing is making the overall shot flat. I''d have the strap slid down so that you only see her shoulder.</td>', 'This is a beautiful idea. I would scoot her away from the textured wall, intensify the lighting, as the existing is making the overall shot flat. I''d have the strap slid down so that you only see her shoulder.', '2006-11-16 09:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037190, 424873, 15711, '<td valign="top">This would be excellent with a sepia coloration.</td>', 'This would be excellent with a sepia coloration.', '2006-11-16 09:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037230, 427030, 52945, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good concept.<br/> <br/>The B&amp;W conversion was done well, focus looks to be spot on.<br/> <br/>Just nitpicking, but being further away from the background would have helped to throw it a bit out of focus, as it is a bit distracting. That would also get rid of the shadow cast on the background by the subject. The hightlights in the background also seem to be a bit blown out. Maybe use a darker background with a more suble texture?<br/> <br/>I would have gone with a slightly more relaxed crop, do that the hats don''t run into the edge of the frame. Would have been better if the left eye was either visible or completely hidden, it looks a bit strange being half there.</td>', 'Nice shot, good concept. The B&W conversion was done well, focus looks to be spot on. Just nitpicking, but being further away from the background would have helped to throw it a bit out of focus, as it is a bit distracting. That would also get rid of the shadow cast on the background by the subject. The hightlights in the background also seem to be a bit blown out. Maybe use a darker background with a more suble texture? I would have gone with a slightly more relaxed crop, do that the hats don''t run into the edge of the frame. Would have been better if the left eye was either visible or completely hidden, it looks a bit strange being half there.', '2006-11-16 10:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037232, 427189, 64209, '<td valign="top">Nice lines, like the lighting and pose</td>', 'Nice lines, like the lighting and pose', '2006-11-16 10:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037239, 427452, 64209, '<td valign="top">Nice shot I like the softness on the guitar</td>', 'Nice shot I like the softness on the guitar', '2006-11-16 10:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037242, 427230, 64209, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the moment</td>', 'Nice capture of the moment', '2006-11-16 10:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037259, 426134, 66635, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to make of this one.  On the one hand, it is visually pleasing -- which is a positive.  But I have a very hard time reconciling the partial nudity with the images of Middle Eastern Muslim culture that these clothes conjur in my mind.  Maybe this is supposed to be a rebellious woman rejecting her burka.  That would be interesting.  But, her skin makes her look like an Anglo, which, for me, makes the scene look fake.  Add-in the English graffiti in the background, and it doesn''t work for me.  Probably you never intended any of that and I''m probably reading something into it that isn''t there -- based on my own environment.  Please tell me if I''m completely off-base.  In any case, it''s a far better photograph technically than I could do.</td>', 'I don''t know what to make of this one.  On the one hand, it is visually pleasing -- which is a positive.  But I have a very hard time reconciling the partial nudity with the images of Middle Eastern Muslim culture that these clothes conjur in my mind.  Maybe this is supposed to be a rebellious woman rejecting her burka.  That would be interesting.  But, her skin makes her look like an Anglo, which, for me, makes the scene look fake.  Add-in the English graffiti in the background, and it doesn''t work for me.  Probably you never intended any of that and I''m probably reading something into it that isn''t there -- based on my own environment.  Please tell me if I''m completely off-base.  In any case, it''s a far better photograph technically than I could do.', '2006-11-16 10:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
