(3037520, 427543, 64175, '<td valign="top">I think the crop on this photo takes out half of the primary subject matter and thus takes something away from the photo.  The greyish background makes the photo come off a bit flat. Score: 4.</td>', 'I think the crop on this photo takes out half of the primary subject matter and thus takes something away from the photo.  The greyish background makes the photo come off a bit flat. Score: 4.', '2006-11-16 11:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037530, 427357, 64175, '<td valign="top">Since the first soldier is cropped, I might suggest doing the same crop to the solider on the right which would frame the middle soldier well. Right now the photo feels a little unbalanced to me with most of the dark greens being on the left half of the shot. Score: 5.</td>', 'Since the first soldier is cropped, I might suggest doing the same crop to the solider on the right which would frame the middle soldier well. Right now the photo feels a little unbalanced to me with most of the dark greens being on the left half of the shot. Score: 5.', '2006-11-16 11:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037535, 426607, 64175, '<td valign="top">The hat itself is beautiful as is the leai (sp) beneath it.  There is so much going on in the background though with the bright lights, various leaves, additional flowers and such that the hat and all of it''s great detail starts to get lost in the photo.</td>', 'The hat itself is beautiful as is the leai (sp) beneath it.  There is so much going on in the background though with the bright lights, various leaves, additional flowers and such that the hat and all of it''s great detail starts to get lost in the photo.', '2006-11-16 11:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037542, 427445, 64175, '<td valign="top">Rather than the cutout(?), I think I would prefer to see just an empty hat with the same composition setup.  Nice colors, but the white face thing just really takes away from the photo. Score: 5.</td>', 'Rather than the cutout(?), I think I would prefer to see just an empty hat with the same composition setup.  Nice colors, but the white face thing just really takes away from the photo. Score: 5.', '2006-11-16 12:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
