(3039257, 427262, 50034, '<td valign="top">Great Portrait &amp; Expression!</td>', 'Great Portrait & Expression!', '2006-11-17 00:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039265, 427373, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very exciting. How did you do this with basic editing?</td>', 'Very exciting. How did you do this with basic editing?', '2006-11-17 00:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039269, 427173, 66384, '<td valign="top">Terrific.  Something very ''40s about this.</td>', 'Terrific.  Something very ''40s about this.', '2006-11-17 00:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039277, 427127, 66384, '<td valign="top">She''s adorable. Very nice portrait.</td>', 'She''s adorable. Very nice portrait.', '2006-11-17 01:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039290, 427536, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very pretty girl. The blowing hair and the mink around the neck make this look very cold - as though the hat is absolutely necessary. The shot is really nice.  Just one thing bothers me -- the spots on the front of the hat.  I can''t tell what they are so they become distracting.</td>', 'Very pretty girl. The blowing hair and the mink around the neck make this look very cold - as though the hat is absolutely necessary. The shot is really nice.  Just one thing bothers me -- the spots on the front of the hat.  I can''t tell what they are so they become distracting.', '2006-11-17 01:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039297, 427225, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very effective. Definitely about the hat. And the other hat (in the old photo) is also a nice touch.</td>', 'Very effective. Definitely about the hat. And the other hat (in the old photo) is also a nice touch.', '2006-11-17 01:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039299, 427391, 66384, '<td valign="top">It took me a long time to find the hat. This seems more about the mountains (or glaciers?) than the hat.</td>', 'It took me a long time to find the hat. This seems more about the mountains (or glaciers?) than the hat.', '2006-11-17 01:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039302, 427556, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is marvelous! She''s fascinating, and the hat looks great on her.</td>', 'This is marvelous! She''s fascinating, and the hat looks great on her.', '2006-11-17 01:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039306, 427301, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very funny take on the challenge. This is definitely ''gear''. I wish the hands weren''t blurred. Actually I think I would like it better without the hands - they''re distracting.</td>', 'Very funny take on the challenge. This is definitely ''gear''. I wish the hands weren''t blurred. Actually I think I would like it better without the hands - they''re distracting.', '2006-11-17 01:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039316, 427118, 66384, '<td valign="top">Great back lighting to bring the attention right to the veil.</td>', 'Great back lighting to bring the attention right to the veil.', '2006-11-17 01:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039322, 427567, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot of a horrifying subject. Is it a mask (which would be headgear) on the actual head?</td>', 'Very nice shot of a horrifying subject. Is it a mask (which would be headgear) on the actual head?', '2006-11-17 01:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039326, 427520, 66384, '<td valign="top">I guess that qualifies -- it''s on the head. Cute kid.</td>', 'I guess that qualifies -- it''s on the head. Cute kid.', '2006-11-17 01:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039330, 427079, 66384, '<td valign="top">Funny idea. Lighting seems a bit harsh.</td>', 'Funny idea. Lighting seems a bit harsh.', '2006-11-17 01:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039333, 426141, 66384, '<td valign="top">Too bad you didn''t get the whole hat. The man on the left makes this look like an average sort of snapshot IMO.</td>', 'Too bad you didn''t get the whole hat. The man on the left makes this look like an average sort of snapshot IMO.', '2006-11-17 01:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039341, 427409, 66384, '<td valign="top">The eyes really compete with the tiara for attention. Maybe if it wasn''t cropped so tight, the tiara would stand out better.</td>', 'The eyes really compete with the tiara for attention. Maybe if it wasn''t cropped so tight, the tiara would stand out better.', '2006-11-17 01:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039344, 427437, 66384, '<td valign="top">Good shot. I''d like it a little better if some of the bottom was cropped.</td>', 'Good shot. I''d like it a little better if some of the bottom was cropped.', '2006-11-17 01:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039350, 426156, 66384, '<td valign="top">I can sort of see the crown, but this seems more about the stamp than the headgear.</td>', 'I can sort of see the crown, but this seems more about the stamp than the headgear.', '2006-11-17 01:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039358, 427492, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice touch having headgear on both the horse and rider.</td>', 'Nice touch having headgear on both the horse and rider.', '2006-11-17 02:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039360, 427543, 66384, '<td valign="top">This appears over exposed on my monitor.</td>', 'This appears over exposed on my monitor.', '2006-11-17 02:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039362, 427409, 31443, '<td valign="top">The focus on this little girl is way off and the straight on perspective doesn''t favor her much either...would have been so nice to have a profile sideview of her and her pretty crown though..</td>', 'The focus on this little girl is way off and the straight on perspective doesn''t favor her much either...would have been so nice to have a profile sideview of her and her pretty crown though..', '2006-11-17 02:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039366, 427611, 66384, '<td valign="top">It looks over exposed on my monitor. I think a levels adjustment would vastly improve this shot. I like the composition.</td>', 'It looks over exposed on my monitor. I think a levels adjustment would vastly improve this shot. I like the composition.', '2006-11-17 02:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039371, 427086, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the plug! It took me a while to understand what I was seeing and how it pertained to headwear.</td>', 'Nice shot of the plug! It took me a while to understand what I was seeing and how it pertained to headwear.', '2006-11-17 02:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039373, 425531, 66384, '<td valign="top">DNMC (Too far out of the box for me.) Otherwise an intriguing shot.</td>', 'DNMC (Too far out of the box for me.) Otherwise an intriguing shot.', '2006-11-17 02:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039374, 426162, 66384, '<td valign="top">Sorry, the hats not the focal point of this photo. ;)</td>', 'Sorry, the hats not the focal point of this photo. ;)', '2006-11-17 02:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039376, 427390, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but needs some levels adjustment.</td>', 'Nice composition, but needs some levels adjustment.', '2006-11-17 02:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039377, 425767, 66384, '<td valign="top">Funny idea. I guess that is headwear.</td>', 'Funny idea. I guess that is headwear.', '2006-11-17 02:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039379, 425098, 66384, '<td valign="top">While the hat is the largest object, the Knob Creek seems to be the real subject of this shot. I do like the still life a lot.</td>', 'While the hat is the largest object, the Knob Creek seems to be the real subject of this shot. I do like the still life a lot.', '2006-11-17 02:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039380, 425680, 34891, '<td valign="top">Essentially what you''d see if you got drunk and walked into a hat store. Wacky.  I wouldn''t have expected a fisheye or whatever this is to make a hat store in ambient light interesting, but it kind of did. Shooting from a crouch may have made the store look more expansive, if that''s what you were going for.</td>', 'Essentially what you''d see if you got drunk and walked into a hat store. Wacky.  I wouldn''t have expected a fisheye or whatever this is to make a hat store in ambient light interesting, but it kind of did. Shooting from a crouch may have made the store look more expansive, if that''s what you were going for.', '2006-11-17 02:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039381, 427379, 39243, '<td valign="top">I am sorry but I don''t get this one. Interesting photo but not sure how it is headwear.</td>', 'I am sorry but I don''t get this one. Interesting photo but not sure how it is headwear.', '2006-11-17 02:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039382, 426134, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture of a not very beautiful thing.</td>', 'Beautiful picture of a not very beautiful thing.', '2006-11-17 02:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039384, 426028, 66384, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2006-11-17 02:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039386, 426141, 34891, '<td valign="top">Kind of wish I could see his style from the front and without the random headless passerby, but I understand if you didn''t want to hound what appears to be a homeless man for a candid. It seems like there was only one real opportunity to take this, and that''s a lot better than nothing, in my opinion anyway.</td>', 'Kind of wish I could see his style from the front and without the random headless passerby, but I understand if you didn''t want to hound what appears to be a homeless man for a candid. It seems like there was only one real opportunity to take this, and that''s a lot better than nothing, in my opinion anyway.', '2006-11-17 02:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039387, 427186, 66384, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I just don''t see what this has to do with headwear. Nice action shot though.</td>', 'Sorry, I just don''t see what this has to do with headwear. Nice action shot though.', '2006-11-17 02:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039389, 427408, 66384, '<td valign="top">Poor thing. He looks miserable. Nice photo.</td>', 'Poor thing. He looks miserable. Nice photo.', '2006-11-17 02:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039392, 427573, 39243, '<td valign="top">Ladies and gentlemen we have a winner! 9</td>', 'Ladies and gentlemen we have a winner! 9', '2006-11-17 02:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039393, 425785, 34891, '<td valign="top">Nice! Would have liked the color version more, but that''s just personal preference.</td>', 'Nice! Would have liked the color version more, but that''s just personal preference.', '2006-11-17 02:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039396, 426245, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice idea! And good character study. This picture says a lot.</td>', 'Nice idea! And good character study. This picture says a lot.', '2006-11-17 02:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
