(3039470, 426307, 49643, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting &amp; clarity.</td>', 'Nice lighting & clarity.', '2006-11-17 05:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039475, 427303, 49643, '<td valign="top">Funny but very sharp &amp; clear!!</td>', 'Funny but very sharp & clear!!', '2006-11-17 05:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039657, 427326, 36382, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I think it could do with a little more contrast.</td>', 'Good idea, but I think it could do with a little more contrast.', '2006-11-17 08:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039660, 426884, 36382, '<td valign="top">I like the movement in her hair.</td>', 'I like the movement in her hair.', '2006-11-17 08:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039666, 426683, 36382, '<td valign="top">The reds seem slightly oversaturated to me.  It looks like you lost a little bit of detail in the red scarf.  Could just be me though.  I like how you kept it to only two colors.</td>', 'The reds seem slightly oversaturated to me.  It looks like you lost a little bit of detail in the red scarf.  Could just be me though.  I like how you kept it to only two colors.', '2006-11-17 09:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039671, 427573, 36382, '<td valign="top">Super idea.  Love the hat.  I would like to have seen his face though.  I don''t know how you would have done that and still shown the propeller on the hat, however.</td>', 'Super idea.  Love the hat.  I would like to have seen his face though.  I don''t know how you would have done that and still shown the propeller on the hat, however.', '2006-11-17 09:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039681, 427118, 36382, '<td valign="top">I like how the long shadows of the guests draw you to the bride.  The rim light on the bride is really nice too.  I guess an improvement could be if the building behind the bride were more solid and not so cluttered looking, but you couldn''t control that.</td>', 'I like how the long shadows of the guests draw you to the bride.  The rim light on the bride is really nice too.  I guess an improvement could be if the building behind the bride were more solid and not so cluttered looking, but you couldn''t control that.', '2006-11-17 09:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039709, 427602, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of light and shadow.  Great composition as well.  Don''t care for the desat of the skin, but opinion aside a great photo!</td>', 'Very nice use of light and shadow.  Great composition as well.  Don''t care for the desat of the skin, but opinion aside a great photo!', '2006-11-17 09:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039711, 427384, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great composition and photo.  This really deserves a background more fitting of the theme, the plain white seems to sell this short.</td>', 'Great composition and photo.  This really deserves a background more fitting of the theme, the plain white seems to sell this short.', '2006-11-17 09:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039714, 427564, 42100, '<td valign="top">Strong composition and great color in the feathers.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Strong composition and great color in the feathers.  Nicely done!', '2006-11-17 09:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039732, 427308, 42100, '<td valign="top">Another SP that is very fun and funky.  Very nicely done, you have a real knack for these kind of photos!</td>', 'Another SP that is very fun and funky.  Very nicely done, you have a real knack for these kind of photos!', '2006-11-17 09:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039742, 426854, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great composition and excellent technicals.  This has a very post-apocalyptic feel with the respirator.  Great job!</td>', 'Great composition and excellent technicals.  This has a very post-apocalyptic feel with the respirator.  Great job!', '2006-11-17 09:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039747, 427484, 42100, '<td valign="top">A very fun portrait with an excellent composition and technicals.  Well done!</td>', 'A very fun portrait with an excellent composition and technicals.  Well done!', '2006-11-17 09:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039758, 426247, 42100, '<td valign="top">Very cool, a very artsy photo with 60''s high fashion flavour.  Technicals are excellent, but it''s the creative that really makes this great.<br/> <br/><i>edit for typo</i><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-22 10:24:26.</i></td>', 'Very cool, a very artsy photo with 60''s high fashion flavour.  Technicals are excellent, but it''s the creative that really makes this great. edit for typo', '2006-11-17 09:24:14.000000', '2006-11-22 10:24:26.000000', 1),
(3039819, 427602, 31443, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this shot except the colorless skin, a little too pale and blue..</td>', 'I like everything about this shot except the colorless skin, a little too pale and blue..', '2006-11-17 09:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039887, 425796, 42100, '<td valign="top">Great composition and perfect choice of DOF.  Very period looking, in fact it looks right off the set of a Hollywood blockbuster.</td>', 'Great composition and perfect choice of DOF.  Very period looking, in fact it looks right off the set of a Hollywood blockbuster.', '2006-11-17 10:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039922, 427009, 42100, '<td valign="top">Love the concept and the set-up, but the background drags this down.  The cars and those big chunky white mailbox posts really pull the eye away from the subject at hand.  Now I feel a little guilty dwelling on what is a minor issue on a petty damn clever photo.</td>', 'Love the concept and the set-up, but the background drags this down.  The cars and those big chunky white mailbox posts really pull the eye away from the subject at hand.  Now I feel a little guilty dwelling on what is a minor issue on a petty damn clever photo.', '2006-11-17 10:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040104, 427408, 36850, '<td valign="top">This is the best picture ever!!!</td>', 'This is the best picture ever!!!', '2006-11-17 12:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040139, 427497, 67335, '<td valign="top">Not my style...<br/>It would be better if it was lightened up.</td>', 'Not my style...It would be better if it was lightened up.', '2006-11-17 12:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040143, 427596, 67335, '<td valign="top">She almost looks like a doll! <br/>Nice colours.</td>', 'She almost looks like a doll! Nice colours.', '2006-11-17 12:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
