(3040688, 427343, 50034, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of frame!  I believe that this is the largest frame I have ever seen used on DPC, but IMHO it also works in your favor for this photo.  This hat seems a bit stark in color &amp; geometry, therefore the frame seems to balance the weight...at it does to me!  Much success to you!  :)</td>', 'Interesting choice of frame!  I believe that this is the largest frame I have ever seen used on DPC, but IMHO it also works in your favor for this photo.  This hat seems a bit stark in color & geometry, therefore the frame seems to balance the weight...at it does to me!  Much success to you!  :)', '2006-11-17 16:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040699, 426845, 50034, '<td valign="top">Pretty lady!  I would love to see a rendering with a tighter crop with minimal space above her head &amp; her left side with her right arm slightly clipped &amp; bottom edge of crop at the point where pinky &amp; fraying meet.  I t could be interesting!  Cheers!  :)</td>', 'Pretty lady!  I would love to see a rendering with a tighter crop with minimal space above her head & her left side with her right arm slightly clipped & bottom edge of crop at the point where pinky & fraying meet.  I t could be interesting!  Cheers!  :)', '2006-11-17 16:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
