(3043923, 425300, 64209, '<td valign="top">I like it, especially the way you captured the textures, but I keep thinking up hundreds of jokes about how the cap got there! Score 8</td>', 'I like it, especially the way you captured the textures, but I keep thinking up hundreds of jokes about how the cap got there! Score 8', '2006-11-19 15:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
