(3044106, 425531, 35602, '<td valign="top">Can''t really see anything.  Just a few lines and a spot of light in the upper right.  Sorry, but it could be my monitor just is too dark.</td>', 'Can''t really see anything.  Just a few lines and a spot of light in the upper right.  Sorry, but it could be my monitor just is too dark.', '2006-11-19 16:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
