(3048677, 427189, 48890, '<td valign="top">Not bad for a set-up, if not for the overexposed flat spot on the chin.</td>', 'Not bad for a set-up, if not for the overexposed flat spot on the chin.', '2006-11-20 18:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3048702, 427589, 48890, '<td valign="top">The on-camera flash ruins the light, the horizon goes right into the left ear of the model, the colours in the sky are over-saturated, and the shot is over-sharpened, on top of that.  But, the most important question is this: why was this shot taken, in the first place?  Just to shoot a hat for a challenge?</td>', 'The on-camera flash ruins the light, the horizon goes right into the left ear of the model, the colours in the sky are over-saturated, and the shot is over-sharpened, on top of that.  But, the most important question is this: why was this shot taken, in the first place?  Just to shoot a hat for a challenge?', '2006-11-20 18:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3048725, 427342, 48890, '<td valign="top">What I see is a cacophony of colours here, sorry.  The multiple shadows, cast by the hat''s rim onto the face of the girl, add to the poor impression from this image.  On top of that, the girl is actually not playing the recorder, but is holding it for the camera, while saying "cheese".  Depending on your tolerances, this may be good enough for your family album.</td>', 'What I see is a cacophony of colours here, sorry.  The multiple shadows, cast by the hat''s rim onto the face of the girl, add to the poor impression from this image.  On top of that, the girl is actually not playing the recorder, but is holding it for the camera, while saying "cheese".  Depending on your tolerances, this may be good enough for your family album.', '2006-11-20 18:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3048726, 426307, 48890, '<td valign="top">a stock image</td>', 'a stock image', '2006-11-20 18:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3048735, 427307, 48890, '<td valign="top">A different perspective would turn this into a nice environmental portrait.  This way, it looks as if the bulldozer is going to run the man over in the next second.</td>', 'A different perspective would turn this into a nice environmental portrait.  This way, it looks as if the bulldozer is going to run the man over in the next second.', '2006-11-20 18:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
