(3052534, 425961, 64446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by klstover:</b></div><hr/><i> I don''t think this was a disservice. I think the idea to honor the veterans comes across in this image.  Even though it isn''t a technically great photo I admire your message and I applaud your sharing the photo with us. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I make <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=53316" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">klstover</a>''s words mine too!</td>', 'Originally posted by klstover: I don''t think this was a disservice. I think the idea to honor the veterans comes across in this image.  Even though it isn''t a technically great photo I admire your message and I applaud your sharing the photo with us.  I make  klstover''s words mine too!', '2006-11-22 00:42:30.000000', NULL, 0),
