(3052733, 427602, 22734, '<td valign="top">A most powerful presentation to lead the field in this challenge. The captivating stare is piercing more so because of the partial view of the face. The dangling yellow amber stones adds to its magic. Indeed super strong presentation because it has been achieved in b.e.<br/> <br/>A big congratulations on this study and of course, the Blue to reward your superior effort! Rudy, your talent appears to multiply like rabbits. lol</td>', 'A most powerful presentation to lead the field in this challenge. The captivating stare is piercing more so because of the partial view of the face. The dangling yellow amber stones adds to its magic. Indeed super strong presentation because it has been achieved in b.e. A big congratulations on this study and of course, the Blue to reward your superior effort! Rudy, your talent appears to multiply like rabbits. lol', '2006-11-22 01:10:09.000000', NULL, 0),
