(3053923, 427549, 28276, '<td valign="top">this, overall, is a very nice portrait...  with advanced editing, you could have helped it quite a but, but with basic, i think there were  three things that pushed people to click 5 over 6 :<br/> <br/>1) the light on the shoulder''s a little harsh... not much... just a little.<br/> <br/>2) the background''s a distraction.  a solid white would have been nice to bring out the dark hat.<br/> <br/>3) hat to point this one out, but it''s there...  a little makeup over the uh... blimish on his nose would have helped...  in advanced you could have cloned it out, but in basic we have to think a little bit ahead...<br/> <br/>hope that helps...</td>', 'this, overall, is a very nice portrait...  with advanced editing, you could have helped it quite a but, but with basic, i think there were  three things that pushed people to click 5 over 6 : 1) the light on the shoulder''s a little harsh... not much... just a little. 2) the background''s a distraction.  a solid white would have been nice to bring out the dark hat. 3) hat to point this one out, but it''s there...  a little makeup over the uh... blimish on his nose would have helped...  in advanced you could have cloned it out, but in basic we have to think a little bit ahead... hope that helps...', '2006-11-22 09:59:39.000000', NULL, 0),
