(3054033, 426854, 67841, '<td valign="top">You know how it is when you''re voting &amp; you''re looking at image after image -- it gets a bit mechanical.  This one takes a little thought in order to appreciate it &amp; though I didn''t score it low I''m sure I would have scored it higher had I studied it a bit more.  Lesson learned on my part, anyway! It is a nice shot &amp; probably would have done better in an advanced editing challenge where you could bring back a bit of the mask.</td>', 'You know how it is when you''re voting & you''re looking at image after image -- it gets a bit mechanical.  This one takes a little thought in order to appreciate it & though I didn''t score it low I''m sure I would have scored it higher had I studied it a bit more.  Lesson learned on my part, anyway! It is a nice shot & probably would have done better in an advanced editing challenge where you could bring back a bit of the mask.', '2006-11-22 10:35:08.000000', NULL, 0),
