(3054371, 426928, 714, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of them all.  Love the warm feel and her lovely smiley.  Thank goodness you didn''t use neat image like the top 3. Wonder if that is why you didn''t win..hehehe..</td>', 'This is my favorite of them all.  Love the warm feel and her lovely smiley.  Thank goodness you didn''t use neat image like the top 3. Wonder if that is why you didn''t win..hehehe..', '2006-11-22 12:08:29.000000', NULL, 0),
