(3056906, 426156, 66923, '<td valign="top">Hmm, thanks for the votes, especially to that good soul who found it funny enough to give it a ten. This was more a conceptual shot, I do not think it had to be a hat in there by all costs to make it a good shot. I am a bit dissapointed with the result, but what can I do... It seems like I will never get a ribbon here, judging by the way most of ppl see photography around here. At least now i know not to hope for anything, just take it as it is.<br/> <br/>And one more thing, why give some1 1?? I never give a vote less than 5, I only score the shots i like, but never less than 5. I guess I will have to work on that and stop being a good boy:)</td>', 'Hmm, thanks for the votes, especially to that good soul who found it funny enough to give it a ten. This was more a conceptual shot, I do not think it had to be a hat in there by all costs to make it a good shot. I am a bit dissapointed with the result, but what can I do... It seems like I will never get a ribbon here, judging by the way most of ppl see photography around here. At least now i know not to hope for anything, just take it as it is. And one more thing, why give some1 1?? I never give a vote less than 5, I only score the shots i like, but never less than 5. I guess I will have to work on that and stop being a good boy:)', '2006-11-23 04:20:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3056947, 426046, 48389, '<td valign="top">WAY TO GO RINA!! Beautiful colours, the skin tones are excellent and composition is spot on (imho!) Well done on your 7+ score! :o)</td>', 'WAY TO GO RINA!! Beautiful colours, the skin tones are excellent and composition is spot on (imho!) Well done on your 7+ score! :o)', '2006-11-23 05:15:54.000000', NULL, 0),
