(3057045, 426156, 49109, '<td valign="top">Funny, but u could have put it on a scanner instead of taking a photo. That may be the reason u got a lot of low votes. Other reasons may be the excessive border (though it matches the stamps border, lot of voter don''t like any borders).  Also, the crop might have been less close, I had preferred to see the hole stamp (why not make it a portrait format with a decent angle of the subject).</td>', 'Funny, but u could have put it on a scanner instead of taking a photo. That may be the reason u got a lot of low votes. Other reasons may be the excessive border (though it matches the stamps border, lot of voter don''t like any borders).  Also, the crop might have been less close, I had preferred to see the hole stamp (why not make it a portrait format with a decent angle of the subject).', '2006-11-23 06:30:09.000000', NULL, 0),
