(3058354, 427409, 55838, '<td valign="top">Although I must agree with those who commented on the focus of this pic, I was one of your twenty 6''s.  I stopped on this pic for a while during voting - it has an element of sweetness and it reminded me how every little girl wants to be a princess (and should be somebody''s princess).  Give your little princess a kiss for me.</td>', 'Although I must agree with those who commented on the focus of this pic, I was one of your twenty 6''s.  I stopped on this pic for a while during voting - it has an element of sweetness and it reminded me how every little girl wants to be a princess (and should be somebody''s princess).  Give your little princess a kiss for me.', '2006-11-23 21:19:48.000000', NULL, 0),
