(3064787, 427560, 6388, '<td valign="top">so you knew it wouldn''t do well...yet you entered it anyway.  hm.  didn''t we talk about this? :)  and it has nothing to do with it not being over-saturated, a beautiful landscape, blah blah blah.  There are plenty of examples of out of the box photos on DP that score well, so don''t blame it on that.<br/> <br/>the fact is it''s a technically mediocre photograph with an atrocious border.  The concept and the crop are excellent, but the blown highlights in the hat and her tongue, mixed with the marginal focus is what resulted in the poor score.<br/> <br/>it''s a great keepsake and worth a thousand smiles, but the score was about what it deserved.<br/> <br/>something goofy happened with either the crop or the border too...not sure what made that 1 pixel line of red show up at the bottom.<br/> <br/>either way...you said you wanted honest, so there''s my honest :D<br/> <br/>P</td>', 'so you knew it wouldn''t do well...yet you entered it anyway.  hm.  didn''t we talk about this? :)  and it has nothing to do with it not being over-saturated, a beautiful landscape, blah blah blah.  There are plenty of examples of out of the box photos on DP that score well, so don''t blame it on that. the fact is it''s a technically mediocre photograph with an atrocious border.  The concept and the crop are excellent, but the blown highlights in the hat and her tongue, mixed with the marginal focus is what resulted in the poor score. it''s a great keepsake and worth a thousand smiles, but the score was about what it deserved. something goofy happened with either the crop or the border too...not sure what made that 1 pixel line of red show up at the bottom. either way...you said you wanted honest, so there''s my honest :D P', '2006-11-27 02:40:15.000000', NULL, 0),
